WEBVTT

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:05.640
when creating documents within word

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:07.589
there may be occasions where you wish to

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.540
include some interactive element within

00:00:07.589 --> 00:00:13.110
the document so just check boxes or

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:14.519
drop-down lists to do this you would

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:16.830
need to use the tools that are featured

00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:18.660
on the Developer tab so if you look at

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:20.730
the top of your toolbar if the

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:23.070
development tab isn't available you

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:25.170
would first need to activate it to do

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:28.920
that if you go along to the word menu

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:31.500
and select Preferences and then ribbon

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:33.270
in tool bar and on the ribbon toolbar on

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.940
the right hand side you can see that the

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:37.800
main tabs are all ticked if the

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.020
developer tab isn't ticked you would

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.210
just need to tick that select Save and

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:45.149
then that will activate the Developer

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:47.100
tab so once you're on the Developer tab

00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:49.559
you'll see a range of tools that can be

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.390
used to add various functionality to the

00:00:49.559 --> 00:00:53.640
document the two that we're going to

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:56.940
focus on our check boxes aren't combo

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:58.670
box so for this first letter I'm just

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:01.109
going to add some simple check boxes

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:03.030
what I needed to do is place makers are

00:01:01.109 --> 00:01:04.619
to the right of the first option and I'm

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:07.320
gonna use the tab key to line them up

00:01:04.619 --> 00:01:09.210
just a little bit further away and then

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:12.180
I'm gonna click the check box icon which

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:15.479
will then insert a check box I will

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:20.299
repeat that for the next five options so

00:01:15.479 --> 00:01:23.630
I move it down tab key add the check box

00:01:20.299 --> 00:01:29.150
use the tab key check box

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:32.430
a tab key to line them up and finally

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:34.079
the last check box so now I have all the

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:36.299
check boxes inserted and that all lined

00:01:34.079 --> 00:01:38.430
up and now I need to make them active

00:01:36.299 --> 00:01:40.890
and to do that I need to click on the

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:43.799
protect form once you've clicked on the

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:47.310
protect form button you can then select

00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:50.579
or deselect the check boxes as required

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:54.240
I can't edit any of the rest of the

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:56.420
document however anyone could unprotect

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:58.500
the form and then make changes to

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:01.049
protect the document fully you would

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:03.439
need to add a password and to do that

00:02:01.049 --> 00:02:06.090
you would need to go to the Tools menu

00:02:03.439 --> 00:02:09.000
from tools you would select protect

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:10.979
document that will then allow you to add

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:13.900
a password and the protection you're

00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:19.870
looking for is to protect the document

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:21.519
four forms at the password select your

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:27.280
care and we'll ask you to repeat the

00:02:21.519 --> 00:02:28.329
password select your care and that is

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:30.670
now set

00:02:28.329 --> 00:02:33.640
so once the document has been protected

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:35.470
with a password by clicking on that you

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:41.379
would need to enter a password to

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:43.359
unprotect the document as well an ardent

00:02:41.379 --> 00:02:45.849
checkboxes there may be occasions where

00:02:43.359 --> 00:02:47.379
you wish to add a drop-down box so as

00:02:45.849 --> 00:02:48.790
you can see I've slightly edited the

00:02:47.379 --> 00:02:51.040
letter that I was working with and

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:52.659
reduced some of the options I'm now

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.480
gonna add some drop-down lists which

00:02:52.659 --> 00:02:57.159
will indicate a specific number and then

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.720
the reader can then select that number

00:02:57.159 --> 00:03:01.629
to see which experience that they're

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:04.180
interested in so again I'm on the

00:03:01.629 --> 00:03:06.670
Developer tab and what I need to do is

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:10.180
I'm going to add your combo box so I'm

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:12.870
going to use the tab cages to space the

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:15.730
drop-down list away from the option

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:18.819
select a combo box and then click on

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:21.069
options now it's basically asking me

00:03:18.819 --> 00:03:23.560
what I want to include in the drop-down

00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:27.810
list so the first thing I'm going to add

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:37.449
some numbers so I click one and add that

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:41.019
two three four and finally five plus at

00:03:37.449 --> 00:03:43.030
that so we now have all of the options I

00:03:41.019 --> 00:03:45.760
want in the drop-down list and I'm just

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:47.680
going to edit the name so I just drop

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:50.680
down one remove the - from there and

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:53.400
click look here and that will have added

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:54.909
the drop-down list so I click on that

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:57.400
nothing happens

00:03:54.909 --> 00:04:00.489
again you have to protect the form so

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:03.329
once it's protected I can then make

00:04:00.489 --> 00:04:07.120
selections from the drop-down list

00:04:03.329 --> 00:04:09.159
I'll just protect the form again now to

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.260
repeat that for the next two options I

00:04:09.159 --> 00:04:14.290
would go again to the combo box do the

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:16.150
options and add the five numbers or

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:18.789
whatever else I wanted to add to the

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:20.349
drop-down box alternatively because I

00:04:18.789 --> 00:04:21.909
know that the drop-down box is going to

00:04:20.349 --> 00:04:25.919
be the same for both of the other

00:04:21.909 --> 00:04:25.919
experiences I can just highlight that

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:31.720
use the command + C to copy it and go

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:34.530
down to the next option use a command in

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:37.810
V and again for that one

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:42.670
come on in V and then if I protect the

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:47.110
form I have now added the drop-down

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:49.720
lists to all three of the options as

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:51.430
with the forms if you wish to protect it

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:54.070
with a password you would need to go to

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:58.050
the Tools menu and then select protect

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:58.050
document and add a password